# Dark painted/matte-black ceiling (the moody near-black ceiling in Figure
# V.1's hallway): dielectric, fairly smooth so it still picks up a soft
# highlight under a strong key light instead of reading as flat void-black.
newmtl ceiling_dark
Kd 1.000 1.000 1.000
map_Kd ../textures/ceiling_dark.tga
Pr 0.4
Pm 0.0
